          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of a PAN bright light consisting of two fixed red lights framing a flickering green light that first remained stationary then moved rapidly before disappearing behind the roof of a house: probable observation of a drone.",
